<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Medeva near-term upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Medeva near-term upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Medeva Plc to near-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it kept Medeva's long-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
